ynth\u00e8se, sauf exception. Notre grand d\u00e9fi actuel est de r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir \u00e0 notre mod\u00e8le serres de demain, \u00e0 la neutralit\u00e9 carbone. En 2026, nous allons lancer notre premier rapport RSE, qui s\u2019appuiera sur de la mati\u00e8re de Demain la Terre.<span class=\"s2\"> \u00bb<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\u00a0\u00bb1_3&Prime; admin_label=\u00a0\u00bbColonne\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.6&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb background_color=\u00a0\u00bbRGBA(255,255,255,0)\u00a0\u00bb overflow-x=\u00a0\u00bbvisible\u00a0\u00bb overflow-y=\u00a0\u00bbvisible\u00a0\u00bb border_radii=\u00a0\u00bbon|15px|15px|15px|15px\u00a0\u00bb border_color_all=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb][et_pb_image src=\u00a0\u00bbhttps:\/\/www.demainlaterre.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Pierre.png\u00a0\u00bb title_text=\u00a0\u00bbPierre\u00a0\u00bb show_bottom_space=\u00a0\u00bboff\u00a0\u00bb align=\u00a0\u00bbcenter\u00a0\u00bb admin_label=\u00a0\u00bbImage\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.6&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb transform_scale_tablet=\u00a0\u00bb89%|89%\u00a0\u00bb transform_scale_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bboff|desktop\u00a0\u00bb transform_translate_tablet=\u00a0\u00bb110px|-55px\u00a0\u00bb transform_translate_phone=\u00a0\u00bb10px|-56px\u00a0\u00bb transform_translate_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bboff|desktop\u00a0\u00bb transform_rotate_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bboff|desktop\u00a0\u00bb transform_skew_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bboff|desktop\u00a0\u00bb transform_origin_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bboff|desktop\u00a0\u00bb vertical_offset=\u00a0\u00bb73px\u00a0\u00bb z_index=\u00a0\u00bb20&Prime; vertical_offset_tablet=\u00a0\u00bb-3%\u00a0\u00bb vertical_offset_phone=\u00a0\u00bb5%\u00a0\u00bb vertical_offset_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bboff|desktop\u00a0\u00bb horizontal_offset_tablet=\u00a0\u00bb-1%\u00a0\u00bb hor